    "governance/gates/GATE25/implementation/analogue-distance-v1.mjs"
  ],
  "implementationReading": {
    "normative": false,
    "notes": [
      "min and max are recomputed for every query over its eligible historical candidate set only; query raw values are neither added to the population nor clamped into [min, max].",
      "finalDistance is summed in distanceFeatureIds order starting from 0; a non-finite intermediate or result is an engine fail-closed condition.",
      "A computed negative zero is emitted as 0 because CanonicalJSON/1 refuses -0; the two are numerically identical, so this is representation, not rounding."
